60,3,1,talk,Asuka,,"Option B would stop the ""ownership"" of spots, but the racks are difficult. Option A or C seems more stable.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,Option A is the most rational. It provides funds and reflects the value of the space.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,George,,"Option C is the most impartial, but Option A satisfies the heavy users.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Option B avoids the ""debtor"" problem of Option A and the ""luck"" problem of Option C.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Mio,,Option B is too much physical work to maintain. Option C is the easiest to manage.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shunichi, but Option B means more shoving in the morning if the racks are clumsy.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Mio, the paperwork for Option A is a burden, but the financial gain is necessary.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,George,,"@Ryuji, do we really want to risk the social harmony for a bit of cash?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,Exactly. The neighboring block's experience with Option A is a warning.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Mio,,I vote for the lottery. It's a one-time event per year. Simple.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Asuka,,I'll go with the lottery too. It's fair and doesn't require monthly billing.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Ryuji,,"I still believe Paid Allocation is the most efficient, despite the effort.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,George,,I agree with the lottery. It resets the unfair history every year.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,I can support the lottery. It's a clean break and doesn't create permanent winners.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
